1
00:00:01,340 --> 00:00:04,880
Son Tinh, Thuy Tinh

2
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:19,570
King Hung the eighteenth has a beautiful daughter named Mi Nuong.

3
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:39,020
There are two men Son Tinh and Thuy Tinh come to ask princess to marry.

4
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:51,280
Son Tinh is mountain god, Thuy Tinh is water god.

5
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,570
King Hung does not know whom to choose, then says:

6
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:09,570
Tomorrow, bring one hundred trays of sticky rice,

7
00:01:10,450 --> 00:01:14,540
one hundred trays of banh chung,

8
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:20,170
nine-tusked elephant,

9
00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:26,140
nine-spur rooster,

10
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:31,280
red-mane horse.

11
00:01:32,250 --> 00:01:39,940
Whoever arrives first will marry Mi Nuong.

12
00:01:41,250 --> 00:01:52,370
Next day, Son Tinh brings offerings first and marries Mi Nuong.

13
00:01:54,080 --> 00:02:02,740
Thuy Tinh is angry, raises water to chase and attack Son Tinh.

14
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:11,280
Houses, rice fields submerged in water.

15
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:22,970
Son Tinh uses magic to raise mountains higher, blocking flood water.

16
00:02:23,910 --> 00:02:30,820
Finally, Thuy Tinh has to retreat.

17
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:38,800
From then, every year Thuy Tinh also raises water to attack Son Tinh, causing floods.

18
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:48,600
But every time Thuy Tinh loses.

